# Code Owners

This file defines individuals or teams that are responsible for code in specific directories or files.

## Format

Each line is a file pattern followed by one or more owners. Owners can be:
- GitHub usernames (e.g., @junnaid-4)
- GitHub teams (e.g., @org/backend-team)

